        <mxCell id="v5_ws_lbl" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17202A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="WebSocket /api/v1/ws?after_seq=uint64" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="1000" x="8680" y="5200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v5_ws" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBFCFC;strokeColor=#34495E;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=24;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#17202A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="SERVER→CLIENT JSON union&lt;br&gt;SnapshotFrame{schema_version:5,kind:&#39;SNAPSHOT&#39;,seq:uint64,payload:SnapshotDTO}&lt;br&gt;DeltaFrame{schema_version:5,kind:&#39;EVENT&#39;|&#39;ROBOT&#39;|&#39;HEALTH&#39;|&#39;DISPATCH&#39;|&#39;PATIENT_CONFLICT&#39;,seq:uint64,occurred_at:RFC3339,payload:typed DTO}&lt;br&gt;ErrorFrame{kind:&#39;ERROR&#39;,code:&#39;SEQ_TOO_OLD&#39;|&#39;UNAUTHORIZED&#39;,message}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;연결 직후: after_seq가 ring buffer(10,000건/24h)에 있으면 seq+1부터 delta; 없으면 SnapshotFrame. HMI는 expected_seq+1이 아니면 socket을 닫고 GET /snapshot 후 재연결. ping10s/pong5s, 최대 frame256KiB, JWT 만료 시 4401." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="316" width="1420" x="8680" y="5230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v5_catalog_lbl" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17202A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="MapCatalogDTO·좌표계" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="900" x="8680" y="5560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v5_catalog" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBFCFC;strokeColor=#34495E;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=24;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#17202A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="MapCatalogDTO{schema_version:uint32,catalog_revision:string,buildings:[{building_id,name,floors:[{floor_id,map_id,map_revision,map_url,sha256,frame_id:&#39;map&#39;,resolution_m,origin:{x,y,yaw},search_areas:[{search_area_id,name,polygon:Point32[]}]}]}]}&lt;br&gt;ID regex [A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}; polygon≥3, non-self-intersecting, map bounds 안. catalog DB만 authoritative. HMI cached revision 제출; MM은 robot loaded_revision까지 모두 같을 때만 Goal 생성." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="1420" x="8680" y="5590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v5_db_boundary" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF9E7;strokeColor=#B7950B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=24;fontColor=#17202A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=9;spacingRight=9;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="DB 경계&lt;br&gt;브라우저·robot PC·vision node는 SQLite에 직접 접근하지 않는다. PC3의 db_writer만 write connection을 소유하고 FastAPI read_pool과 MM startup recovery만 read한다. 모든 외부 출력은 REST/WS/ROS IDL을 거친다. DB schema는 내부 저장 계약이며 네트워크 API가 아니다." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="1420" x="8680" y="5844" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v5_outbox_contract" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF9E7;strokeColor=#B7950B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=24;fontColor=#17202A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=9;spacingRight=9;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="Outbox 전달 상태&lt;br&gt;PENDING: COMMIT 완료/아직 T01 미발행 · PUBLISHED: publish call 성공 · GOAL_ACCEPTED: 필수 Action Goal 수락 · DELAYED: PENDING 30s 초과 · FAILED: operator cancel 또는 terminal infrastructure error. publish 성공만으로 exactly-once를 주장하지 않는다. subscriber 멱등키로 logical side effect 1회를 보장한다. HMI는 이 enum을 그대로 표시한다." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="184" width="1420" x="8680" y="6018" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v5_tf_lbl" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17202A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" value="TF·시간·좌표 소유권" vertex="1">
