        <mxCell id="lidar_controller" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=24;fontColor=#17202A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;spacingBottom=5;" value="&lt;b&gt;WHAT&lt;/b&gt; lidar_fallback_controller · 기본 전략&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HOW&lt;/b&gt; Odom Pose Estimator: current_pose = last_amcl_anchor × (odom_start→odom_now) 2D Transform · Path Follower: 저장 Path에서 lookahead_m=0.3m 목표 선택 · P Control: heading error→angular_z, distance→linear_x, 회전 우선 · max linear=0.1m/s · max angular=0.4rad/s · period=0.1s&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;I/O&lt;/b&gt; 내부 판단값; 연결 화살표의 Dxx 참조&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;STATUS&lt;/b&gt; DEVELOPING" vertex="1">
