        <mxCell id="lidar_depth_gate" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FADBD8;strokeColor=#922B21;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=24;fontColor=#17202A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;spacingBottom=5;" value="&lt;b&gt;WHAT&lt;/b&gt; OAK-D Depth Safety Gate&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HOW&lt;/b&gt; 중앙 40%×40% ROI 최소 depth · Depth 정상 ∧ obstacle≥0.5m → fallback cmd_vel 허용 · Depth 없음 ∨ obstacle&amp;lt;0.5m → geometry_msgs/Twist(0) · 일반 Nav2 cmd_vel과 fallback cmd_vel 제어권 상호배제&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;I/O&lt;/b&gt; 내부 판단값; 연결 화살표의 Dxx 참조&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;STATUS&lt;/b&gt; DEVELOPING" vertex="1">
